  "SC2013": {
    "code": "SC2013",
    "title": "To read lines rather than words, pipe/redirect to a `while read` loop.",
    "fix": "To read lines rather than words, pipe/redirect to a `while read` loop.",
    "rationale": "For loops by default (subject to `$IFS`) read word by word. Additionally, glob expansion will occur.\n\nGiven this text file:\n\n```sh\nfoo *\nbar\n```\n\nThe for loop will print:\n\n```sh\nLine: foo\nLine: aardwark.jpg\nLine: bullfrog.jpg\n...\n```\n\nThe while loop will print:\n\n```sh\nLine: foo *\nLine: bar\n```",
